// OrbitLayoutSeededTests.cs
// Feature: CLAUDE.md "Space scene" (stable layout: jumpgates and sky rotation seeded with 2 * station, sun / planets with
// 300 * station, asteroid count / centre with station; the K'ontrr planet-texture swap; mission 0 halving the orbit planet).
// Expected numbers: generated by an independent Python port of the original's layout code,
//   Reference/research/space_backdrop_sim.py (sim(), skyRot(), dirOf(), planetTexName(): StarSystem::StarSystem /
//   Level::createSpace), the gate formula of Reference/research/space_level_setup.md 3.2 and the asteroid setup of
//   Reference/research/space_props.md 1 (Level::createAsteroids); the K'ontrr rule (textures by file order) applied by hand
//   as CLAUDE.md describes it. Several rows also match the hand-checked tables of those notes (Suteo's gate (108380, 0, 59219)
//   A1 11168 / hidden (184, 0, 120048) A2 16; Var Hastra's hidden gate (73037, 0, 116522); the asteroid samples of stations
//   0 and 10).

